          "start": 510
        },
        "quote": "“Yard, rear” means a yard extending the full width of the lot on which a principal building is located and situated between the rear lot line and a line parallel thereto and passing through the nearest point of the principal building. On corner lots, the rear yard shall be determined pursuant to TMC 18.230.030 .",
